@startuml sequence-manage-fleet
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Manage fleet (UC9)

actor Admin
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Admin -> FE: Open "Fleet administration"
FE -> API: GET /cars/
API -> DB: SELECT all cars
DB --> API: cars
API --> FE: 200 OK [cars]
FE --> Admin: Fleet table
note right of API
  POST / PUT / DELETE are admin-only
  (JWT) — a non-admin gets 403
end note

alt Add
  Admin -> FE: Fill new car form\n(brand, model, year, plate, prices, category, ...)
  FE -> API: POST /cars/ {car}
  create participant "c : Car" as C
  API -> C: <<create>>\n(brand, model, ..., branch_id)
  API -> DB: INSERT c (save the new car)
  DB --> API: saved (c now has its id)
  API --> FE: 201 Created {car}
else Edit
  Admin -> FE: Pick a car and edit form fields
  FE -> API: PUT /cars/{id} {changed fields}
  API -> DB: UPDATE Car
  DB --> API: car
  API --> FE: 200 OK {car}
else Delete
  Admin -> FE: Pick a car and click "Delete"
  FE --> Admin: "Opravdu smazat ...?"
  Admin -> FE: Confirm deletion
  FE -> API: DELETE /cars/{id}
  API -> DB: DELETE Car together with\nall its reservations
  API --> FE: 204 No Content
end

FE -> API: Reload the list (GET /cars/)
API -> DB: SELECT all cars
DB --> API: cars
API --> FE: 200 OK [cars]
FE --> Admin: See updated fleet list
@enduml
